---
layout: layout.njk
summary: Small, complete systems to use in the browser.
---
<h1>Available Demos</h1>
<p class="lead">Small, complete systems to use in the browser. Each one runs on a server of its own, and starts over each night.</p>

<ul class="demos">
    {%- for demo in demos %}
    <li>
        {%- if demo.picture %}
        <a href="{{ demo.page }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="{{ demo.page }}{{ demo.picture }}" alt="" /></a>
        {%- endif %}
        <h2><a href="{{ demo.page }}">{{ demo.title }}</a></h2>
        {% include "health.njk" %}
        <p>{{ demo.summary }}</p>
    </li>
    {%- endfor %}
</ul>
